<section vertical-align="center">
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item>
      <h2>Aufhebung: cancel, preserve, transform</h2>
      <p><b>Aufhebung</b>, often translated as “sublation,” names a double movement: a limited form is negated while something valid within it is preserved in a changed whole.</p>
      <grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug">
        <grid-item colspan="20" background-color="accent">
          <p role="eyebrow">Canceled</p>
          <h3>Domination</h3>
          <p>Unrestricted interruption no longer governs the exchange.</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="20" background-color="palette-3">
          <p role="eyebrow">Preserved</p>
          <h3>The claim to speak</h3>
          <p>Each participant remains entitled to contribute.</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="20" background-color="palette-2">
          <p role="eyebrow">Transformed</p>
          <h3>Reciprocal freedom</h3>
          <p>Participation becomes supported, shared, and answerable.</p>
        </grid-item>
      </grid>
      <freeform-block w="840" h="72">
        <shape preset="line" x="8" y="30" w="245" h="2" stroke="accent" stroke-width="4"></shape>
        <shape preset="line" x="260" y="13" w="2" h="36" stroke="accent" stroke-width="4"></shape>
        <shape preset="line" x="300" y="30" w="240" h="2" stroke="palette-3" stroke-width="4"></shape>
        <shape preset="ellipse" x="405" y="19" w="24" h="24" fill="palette-3" stroke="palette-3" stroke-width="0"></shape>
        <shape preset="rightArrow" x="590" y="20" w="240" h="24" fill="palette-2" stroke-width="0"></shape>
      </freeform-block>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>